WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.858
"Let's go for a walk, Buster," a man said.

2
00:00:05.859 --> 00:00:09.404
He put a leash on his dog.

3
00:00:09.405 --> 00:00:11.722
They went outside.

4
00:00:11.723 --> 00:00:14.936
A big, creepy plant grew in the man's front yard.

5
00:00:14.937 --> 00:00:16.902
"Oh my!" he said.

6
00:00:16.903 --> 00:00:19.957
"Where did that strange plant come from?"

7
00:00:19.958 --> 00:00:22.554
He stepped closer.

8
00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:27.101
Suddenly the plant opened a large mouth.

9
00:00:27.102 --> 00:00:31.435
"Oh no!" the man cried out.

10
00:00:31.436 --> 00:00:35.953
Gulp!

11
00:00:35.954 --> 00:00:40.441
*** "I'm so glad it's Friday," Mara

12
00:00:40.442 --> 00:00:43.793
said. Roxy and her friends were walking home from

13
00:00:43.794 --> 00:00:45.574
school. "Me too," Jack

14
00:00:45.575 --> 00:00:50.627
said. "I can't believe we had three quizzes in one

15
00:00:50.628 --> 00:00:52.539
day." Suddenly Terrell

16
00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:56.093
pointed. "What is that?" Everyone

17
00:00:56.094 --> 00:00:59.766
looked. A creepy plant was growing next to someone's

18
00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:01.969
house. "Wow," Mara

19
00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:05.668
said. "That looks like something from another

20
00:01:05.669 --> 00:01:08.734
planet." "There's a plant like that in my backyard," Jack

21
00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.141
said. "It's a lot bigger

22
00:01:10.142 --> 00:01:12.014
though. My mom was wondering what it

23
00:01:12.015 --> 00:01:13.436
is. We have a vegetable

24
00:01:13.437 --> 00:01:16.320
garden. But we didn't plant anything like

25
00:01:16.321 --> 00:01:20.037
that." Roxy looked at the plant closely as she walked past

26
00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:22.745
it. "I wonder what kind of plant it

27
00:01:22.746 --> 00:01:27.692
is." Terrell laughed. "Maybe it's an alien

28
00:01:27.693 --> 00:01:30.459
plant!" He held out his arms to look like

29
00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:35.854
claws. "Look out, Mara! The alien plant is coming after you!"

30
00:01:35.855 --> 00:01:41.363
Mara rolled her eyes. "You're ridiculous, Terrell."

31
00:01:41.364 --> 00:01:44.671
Jack kept walking. "Come on," he said.

32
00:01:44.672 --> 00:01:48.879
"When we get to my house, I'll show you my plant."

33
00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:51.374
A moment later they got to Jack's house.

34
00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:55.460
Jack was right—the plant in his yard was huge.

35
00:01:55.461 --> 00:02:00.246
It had large bulbs and twisting vines that looked like tentacles.

36
00:02:00.247 --> 00:02:05.444
"Yikes!" Mara said. "You should probably cut that down."

37
00:02:05.445 --> 00:02:07.343
Jack scratched his head.

38
00:02:07.344 --> 00:02:09.968
"I'm afraid to get close to it."

39
00:02:09.969 --> 00:02:14.731
Then he laughed. "Maybe I can get Rocket Girl to cut it down!"

40
00:02:14.732 --> 00:02:19.737
Terrell and Mara laughed.

41
00:02:19.738 --> 00:02:24.173
"Let's take a closer look," Terrell said.

42
00:02:24.174 --> 00:02:26.509
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

43
00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:30.771
She waited while her friends walked into Jack's backyard.

44
00:02:30.772 --> 00:02:35.165
"Mayor Bloom," she whispered. "What's wrong?"

45
00:02:35.166 --> 00:02:37.213
Mayor Bloom looked worried.

46
00:02:37.214 --> 00:02:39.112
"I have a problem, Rocket Girl.

47
00:02:39.113 --> 00:02:41.627
My assistant never came to work today.

48
00:02:41.628 --> 00:02:44.818
Neither did anyone else in my office."

49
00:02:44.819 --> 00:02:46.638
Roxy rubbed her chin.

50
00:02:46.639 --> 00:02:49.598
"Maybe they just wanted the day off."

51
00:02:49.599 --> 00:02:51.561
The mayor shook his head.

52
00:02:51.562 --> 00:02:54.247
"No, they love coming into work.

53
00:02:54.248 --> 00:02:58.060
And Detective Smith told me people keep calling the police station.

54
00:02:58.061 --> 00:03:01.628
They know other people who are missing too."

55
00:03:01.629 --> 00:03:04.296
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

56
00:03:04.297 --> 00:03:08.174
"I'm on my way!"

